SUMMARY:Durham Community Club Fair
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nCome checkout the first ever Durham 
 Community Club Fair in conjunction with the Food Truck Rodeo at Durham Cen
 tral Park!\n\nThe organizers described it as\, “Like a classic high scho
 ol club fair\, local groups will be there to share information about what 
 they do\, maybe give out some freebies\, and chat with folks about joining
 .”\n\nI thought this was such a cool idea for people to be able to conne
 ct with the community and I’m excited to see how it goes. I’ll be ther
 e at a table just chit-chatting with people about the Meetup so please sto
 p by and say hey!\n\n[Map](https://www.canva.com/design/DAHKr4NwG6c/ZP1oWT
 5cxsHr6o1r4UKoDg/view?utm_content=DAHKr4NwG6c&utm_campaign=designshare&utm
 _medium=link2&utm_source=uniquelinks&utlId=hdbcb567710) of the area (subje
 ct to change day of\, but will be updated)
