SUMMARY:Yellowcard in Charlotte: Durham Field Trip Edition 🎸
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nI’m heading to Charlotte for Yello
 wcard featuring New Found Glory and Plain White T’s — and somehow\, de
 spite living in NC for a while\, I’ve never actually been to Charlotte.\
 n\nSo if you’re already going\, thinking about going\, or wanted to go b
 ut didn’t want to make the trip solo… let’s bring a little Durham en
 ergy to the show.\n\nMillennial pop-punk nostalgia\, an out-of-town mini a
 dventure\, and a very valid excuse to scream lyrics like it’s 2003 and y
 our AIM away message is doing emotional damage.\n\nWe can meet there — o
 r if we’re already homies\, we can carpool 🚗\n\nLet’s make it a Dur
 ham-to-Charlotte field trip.\n\nTicketmaster link: https://www.ticketmaste
 r.com/event/2D00638301B510DF
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31450
 2429/
